Package: saddlepoint
Title: Saddlepoint methods with CGF operations
Version: 0.9.0
Date: 2025-08-27
Authors@R: c(
    person("Godrick", "Oketch", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "godrick@berkeley.edu"),
    person("Jesse", "Goodman", role = c("aut")),
    person("Rachel", "Fewster", role = c("aut")))
Maintainer: Godrick Oketch <godrick@berkeley.edu>
Author: Godrick Oketch [aut, cre],
    Jesse Goodman [aut],
    Rachel Fewster [aut]
Description: Implements saddlepoint approximations based on cumulant generating
    functions (CGFs). Distributions are represented as CGF objects that provide
    derivatives needed for saddlepoint approximation methods and can be combined using
    compositional operators (e.g., i.i.d. replication, linear maps, and sums).
    Includes routines for solving saddlepoint equations and for maximum likelihood
    estimation, with optional automatic differentiation support via RTMB.
